{"text":"魏昌尼寺，閹官瀛州刺史李次壽所立也。在里東南角。即中朝牛馬市處也，刑嵇康之所。東臨石橋。此橋南北行。晉太康元年中朝時市南橋也。澄之等蓋見此橋銘，因而以橋為太康初造也。","tags":[{"name":"Office","term":"閹官","refId":null,"text":"閹官","start":5,"end":7},{"name":"Udef_Governor","term":"瀛州刺史","refId":null,"text":"瀛州刺史","start":7,"end":11},{"name":"PersonName","term":"李次壽","refId":null,"text":"李次壽","start":11,"end":14},{"name":"Udef_Products","term":"牛","refId":null,"text":"牛","start":27,"end":28},{"name":"Udef_Products","term":"馬","refId":null,"text":"馬","start":28,"end":29},{"name":"PersonName","term":"嵇康","refId":"dila_A002498","text":"嵇康","start":34,"end":36},{"name":"Udef_Construct","term":"石橋","refId":null,"text":"石橋","start":41,"end":43},{"name":"Date","term":"太康元年","refId":null,"text":"太康元年","start":51,"end":55},{"name":"Date","term":"太康初","refId":null,"text":"太康初","start":77,"end":80}]}